      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CARDIGAN SNIPER (3) made it three wins in succession last start, getting home by 3 metres over 2240m at this track. Has the benefit of a good draw. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role again. AUSTON (7) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1680m at Launceston, finishing second and just 1.1 metres from the winner. Has to contend with a very wide draw. This should be an easier assignment so he is in the right race to find the winners' list. LAKE COMO (4) is the next best after finishing third over 2240m at this track last time out. WHITEHAVEN BOY (5) is a two-year-old colt from the Vince Vallelonga yard on debut. Showed some ability with a minor placing in a recent trial. Will be right there at the business end.",
